{"check": "Asks about the character set used for TatarTTS texts during preprocessing; passage 1 states this exactly.",
 "citations": [{"ref": 1, "quote": "the text files in the dataset underwent a transformation to include only 39 Cyrillic letters and five specific symbols: ’.’, ’,’, ’-’, ’?’, and ’!’."}],
